[en.CHARACTER_BURNT_UMBER_NAME]
Burnt Umber

[en.CHARACTER_BURNT_UMBER_DESC]
A loyal leader of the Kirin Military. He will strictly and seriously execute orders, whether it is to enforce the “Silence” or to lift it.

[zh.CHARACTER_BURNT_UMBER_NAME]
焦赭

[zh.CHARACTER_BURNT_UMBER_DESC]
忠诚的麒麟军队领袖。无论是推行“静默”还是取消“静默”的命令，他都会严格认真执行。
